+// from the asset, bottom-left of the board, small + faint (a map corner
+// credit, like a printed map's imprint). The © renders from the dedicated
+// one-glyph font (font_copyright — the shared atlas never changes); the rest
+// of the line rides the body font.
+dublin_draw_attribution :: proc(v: ^View, b: ^pp.Map_Board) {
+	if len(b.attribution) == 0 {
